# Hightide

> Booking and operations software for accommodation, activity and package businesses.

Hightide is a web-based SaaS platform for surf camps, retreats, adventure lodges, guesthouses, tour operators and similar businesses. It helps operators sell directly online and manage bookings, payments, guest communication and day-to-day operations in one place.

## Who it is for

- Businesses that sell accommodation, activities/tours, or both
- Operators that need packages (ready-made or build-your-own)
- Teams that want direct bookings without marketplace commission on Online Store bookings
- Camps, retreats, lodges, activity centres and specialised operators with shared resources (rooms, guides, equipment)

## Who it is not for

- Pure hourly dive-centre or appointment-diary software use cases
- Enterprises needing heavy custom development as a service
- Marketplaces that need multi-vendor checkout as the core product

## Key capabilities

- Customisable Online Store for accommodation, activities and packages
- Connected booking calendar and booking workspace
- Instant booking or request-only modes
- Stripe and PayPal payments, payment requests and balances
- Linked availability across shared resources
- Day Planner, reports, team access and automated guest emails
- Partner/affiliate referral links and commission reporting
- Optional channel manager add-on for accommodation channels
- Google Analytics 4 and Meta Pixel support

## Pricing (EUR, excl. VAT)

- Basic: from €59/month (or €49/month billed annually) — up to 15 bookable units
- Pro: from €99/month (or €89/month billed annually) — up to 40 bookable units, Custom Store colors, more team access
- Channel Manager add-on and extra bookable units available
- 30-day free trial; no credit card required to start
- No commission on direct Online Store bookings (payment-provider fees still apply)

